cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and the Zenodo deposit."
title: "Analysis code for: The modular evolution of chitinases is governed by coevolution of auxiliary and catalytic domains"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data supporting Pulsford et al. (2026): InterProScan
  domain-annotation reconciliation, domain-count null-model and dereplication
  analyses, GH18-specific domain versatility (phi) calculation, sequence
  similarity network architecture diversity, and phylogenetic trait analyses
  across the prokaryotic and eukaryotic GH18 chitinase family.
type: software
